      "note": "Registers and Coils sheets"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Registers are 0-based and use the Unit 0 addresses of the document, which cover every section of the device. Multi-register values (32-bit counters, serial number, floats) are read here with the most significant register first, as the document states.",
    "Reserved, obsolete and internal registers, and registers reachable only through a section unit (Unit 1 to 3), are left out.",
    "The documents of S107, S117 list identical registers, so they share this map."
  ],
